  "goodToKnow": "Die Sterblichkeit is mortality: die Säuglingssterblichkeit (infant mortality), die Sterblichkeitsrate. During the COVID pandemic, statisticians tracked die Übersterblichkeit (excess mortality) compared with previous years. Philosophically, die Sterblichkeit des Menschen is human mortality. Sterblich means mortal; the opposite is unsterblich. It has no plural."
